      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 4.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "morning, doctor is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.13,
      "end_seconds": 10.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.19,
      "end_seconds": 25.77,
      "duration_seconds": 14.58,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm here because of sharp pain in the left chest when I breathe in. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.17,
      "end_seconds": 29.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.03,
      "end_seconds": 36.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "right, uh, I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.12,
      "end_seconds": 41.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.94,
      "end_seconds": 50.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "about about a month. I'm, I'm on ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, when it hurts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.86,
      "end_seconds": 54.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.35,
      "end_seconds": 57.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.05,
      "end_seconds": 65.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 70.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "A three out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.77,
      "end_seconds": 75.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Right, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.37,
      "end_seconds": 93.98,
      "duration_seconds": 17.61,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get a sore throat earlier as well ah, and there's aching all over as well, five days now as for aching all over, I'd call it moderate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.32,
      "end_seconds": 112.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Have you noticed palpitations, breathlessness at rest or injury to the chest?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.6,
      "end_seconds": 117.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "no, you know, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.96,
      "end_seconds": 121.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Has there been any leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.12,
      "end_seconds": 130.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "not at all, no leg swelling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.15,
      "end_seconds": 136.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 140.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "no weakness or anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.73,
      "end_seconds": 147.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.44,
      "end_seconds": 151.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.31,
      "end_seconds": 155.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.25,
      "end_seconds": 172.18,
      "duration_seconds": 13.93,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.16,
      "end_seconds": 186.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.54,
      "end_seconds": 199.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "I mean, I've had high cholesterol for about ten years now. Yeah, um, I have an underactive thyroid, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.9,
      "end_seconds": 204.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Hm, okay. So, have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.62,
      "end_seconds": 211.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Just keyhole surgery on my gallbladder, two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.34,
      "end_seconds": 216.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.63,
      "end_seconds": 222.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Mm, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.61,
      "end_seconds": 230.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.25,
      "end_seconds": 241.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.57,
      "end_seconds": 268.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 17, temp 36.7 degrees. And BP is 108 over 74, pulse 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.75,
      "end_seconds": 274.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.51,
      "end_seconds": 278.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Okay, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.48,
      "end_seconds": 294.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "air entry is equal on both sides"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.65,
      "end_seconds": 299.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.29,
      "end_seconds": 325.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is viral pleurisy. Regular pain relief makes it easier to take deep breaths, which protects the lung"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.73,
      "end_seconds": 332.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Can you send me for a chest X-ray?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.39,
      "end_seconds": 353.27,
      "duration_seconds": 16.88,
      "text": "Not at this point, no. It isn't indicated yet. One warning sign to remember: you become breathless or the pain changes. In that case don't wait. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.71,
      "end_seconds": 358.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}